  "summary_en": "Japan's Cabinet-approved annual science, technology and innovation strategy, the final-stage implementation plan of the Sixth Basic Plan. It promotes AI, including physical AI and general-purpose AI robots, balancing innovation with risk mitigation under the AI Promotion Act. It also covers research capacity, talent and startups.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Promote innovation while mitigating AI risks based on human-centeredness, human rights and legal compliance.",
